OL,3,AWhite House blocks Microsoft from
OL,4,Aforeign worker hiring program
OL,5,
OL,6,F"No company in the US has abused this
OL,7,Fsystem more than Microsoft," Vance
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FHe went on to claim that the company,
OL,11,Fone of the most valuable in the US, has
OL,12,Fbeen effectively replacing American
OL,13,Fworkers with "foreign indentured
OL,14,Fservants."
